OL,3,GNEWSA'Help us out,' says Hull Fair's
OL,4,A5am clean-up team
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile thousands of people enjoy the
OL,7,Frides, games and food at Hull Fair, a
OL,8,Fteam of council workers begins cleaning
OL,9,Fup long before most visitors are awake.
OL,11,FFrom 05:00 BST each morning, dozens of
OL,12,Fstreet cleansing and waste management
OL,13,Fstaff arrive on site to clear litter,
OL,14,Fempty bins and prepare the fairground
OL,15,Fand surrounding streets for another
OL,16,Fbusy day.
OL,18,FLast year, more than 60 tonnes of
OL,19,Frubbish was removed during the
OL,20,Fweek-long event.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
